{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Clay Puzzle&quot; is a falling-block puzzle game where you target and break apart falling blocks!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972880/extras/f4634b71cfad45ff681cadce0399a86b.poster.avif?t=1757064325\" aria-label=\"A puzzle game screenshot showing blocks being broken as they fall.\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972880/extras/f4634b71cfad45ff681cadce0399a86b.webm?t=1757064325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972880/extras/f4634b71cfad45ff681cadce0399a86b.mp4?t=1757064325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the blocks fall, aim and shoot away the unwanted parts to shape them into a better form!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a limited number of shots for each block formation. You must skillfully shape the blocks with a limited number of shots!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you clear a complete horizontal line, the blocks vanish, and the workers progress in their task. Make combo or clear multiple lines at once to give their progress a big boost!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game progresses, the falling speed gradually increases. Can your aim keep up?</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What will the workers be building as the progress rate hits 100%? You'll have to play to find out!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim, shoot, and shape. Get ready for a falling block puzzle game that puts your aim and judgment to the test!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Estimated Play Time</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Play:</strong> 5\u201310 minutes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100% Achievements:</strong> 1\u20132 hours (depends on your skill!)</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3972880?t=1757064325","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3972880?t=1757064325","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972880/6b15e9932fd73d99e6e090c568151e2771c86f61/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757064325","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972880/6b15e9932fd73d99e6e090c568151e2771c86f61/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757064325","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Clay Puzzle&quot; is a falling-block puzzle game where you target and break apart falling blocks!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972880/extras/f4634b71cfad45ff681cadce0399a86b.poster.avif?t=1757064325\" aria-label=\"A puzzle game screenshot showing blocks being broken as they fall.\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972880/extras/f4634b71cfad45ff681cadce0399a86b.webm?t=1757064325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972880/extras/f4634b71cfad45ff681cadce0399a86b.mp4?t=1757064325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the blocks fall, aim and shoot away the unwanted parts to shape them into a better form!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a limited number of shots for each block formation. You must skillfully shape the blocks with a limited number of shots!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you clear a complete horizontal line, the blocks vanish, and the workers progress in their task. Make combo or clear multiple lines at once to give their progress a big boost!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game progresses, the falling speed gradually increases. Can your aim keep up?</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What will the workers be building as the progress rate hits 100%? You'll have to play to find out!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim, shoot, and shape. Get ready for a falling block puzzle game that puts your aim and judgment to the test!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Estimated Play Time</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Play:</strong> 5\u201310 minutes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100% Achievements:</strong> 1\u20132 hours (depends on your skill!)</p></li></ul>","developers":["pheniki_games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972880/6902bf764ff455353f780752b0a0820675f94d9a/header.jpg?t=1757064325","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"Clay Puzzle","package_groups":[],"p